  "scrollspy": "<div class='sample-scrollspy'><nav aria-label='On this page'><strong>On this page</strong><a href='#scrollspy-overview' data-scrollspy-key='overview'>Overview</a><a href='#scrollspy-behavior' data-scrollspy-key='behavior'>Behavior</a><a href='#scrollspy-accessibility' data-scrollspy-key='accessibility'>Accessibility</a></nav><div class='sample-scrollspy-content' role='region' aria-label='Article sections' tabindex='0'><section data-scrollspy-key='overview'><h4 id='scrollspy-overview'>Overview</h4><p>A scrollspy keeps the section index in sync with the content currently in view.</p><p>Use the links to jump directly to a section.</p></section><section data-scrollspy-key='behavior'><h4 id='scrollspy-behavior'>Behavior</h4><p>The active marker follows the section as you scroll through the article.</p><p>The content remains in place while the index reflects your reading position.</p></section><section data-scrollspy-key='accessibility'><h4 id='scrollspy-accessibility'>Accessibility</h4><p>Each link points to a real section heading, and the current link is announced to assistive technology.</p><p>Scroll this panel or choose a section from the index.</p></section></div></div>",
